1. Astryx (neutral theme)
-------------------------
The look of this package (colour values, radii, shadow recipes, type scale ratios, motion timings)
is derived from the neutral theme of Astryx, https://github.com/meta/astryx. No Astryx package is
installed or bundled: values were read from its source and re-expressed in tokens.json.

